'' pkg/fbx (ADR 0017 §20): the toolchain's fbx library, imported. Headers come through
'' TKO_INCLUDE, not -i: an '-i' directory is also a package root, and a toolchain's inc/
'' that still holds the old fbx/ headers would be the package found.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc tests/modules/src/pkgfbx/main.tiko -o tests/modules/pkgfbx.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' ENV: TKO_INCLUDE=toolchains/tiko-windows/inc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/pkgfbx.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  11 3 tiko
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 2026 29 3
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  7-5
